    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of SolCycle as renowned archaeologist and professor PRIV-8! After being laid off due to budget cuts, you decide to travel in search of a mysterious new artifact but find yourself trapped in a time-loop instead! Now you must learn to navigate the locals\u2019 bartering culture using trade-based mechanics whilst still keeping your goal in mind. Who knows what that artifact could do for you when you finally get it\u2026it\u2019ll just have to be worth the trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this solarpunk post-human world, plant-powered robots now worship the soil, creating civilization and structure that values trade above monetization! Meet inhabitants of this community, such as a priestess of the religious order, a shady merchant, and a well-revered mailman. Learn to navigate each segfault, the phenomenon known to reset your time-loop, and come back stronger and more knowledgeable each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three animal-themed characters to interact and trade with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast of small fruit-themed beings called roros to play with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique location themes with original music!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of SolCycle as renowned archaeologist and professor PRIV-8! After being laid off due to budget cuts, you decide to travel in search of a mysterious new artifact but find yourself trapped in a time-loop instead! Now you must learn to navigate the locals\u2019 bartering culture using trade-based mechanics whilst still keeping your goal in mind. Who knows what that artifact could do for you when you finally get it\u2026it\u2019ll just have to be worth the trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this solarpunk post-human world, plant-powered robots now worship the soil, creating civilization and structure that values trade above monetization! Meet inhabitants of this community, such as a priestess of the religious order, a shady merchant, and a well-revered mailman. Learn to navigate each segfault, the phenomenon known to reset your time-loop, and come back stronger and more knowledgeable each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three animal-themed characters to interact and trade with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast of small fruit-themed beings called roros to play with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique location themes with original music!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Enter the 3D sci-fi world of SolCycle! Play as a robot cat archaeologist, explore a post-human community rebuilt by plant-fueled robots, and barter with the locals in card-based gameplay! Learn to navigate the citizens\u2019 requests while under the spell of a time-loop. Don\u2019t forget to watch the clock!",
